{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/gif_live_on_.gif?t=1741373284\" /><strong>ARKHAM MYSTERIES: CHAPTER ONE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover what should never have been revealed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a <strong>narrative adventure of mystery and exploration</strong>, where every discovery brings you closer to the truth\u2026 or to your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/ARKHAM_MYSTERIES_COVER_3D.png?t=1741373284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As detective <strong>John Graves</strong>, you will follow the trail of the missing <strong>Professor Wellington</strong>, guided by the enigmatic <strong>Samantha Damasco</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/escena_bar.gif?t=1741373284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong> can reveal the unseen. Explore hidden dimensions and unravel enigmas while unknown forces lurk in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/gif_candado.gif?t=1741373284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features &amp; Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-Person Exploration:</strong> Dive into a dark world full of mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Every decision will shape the outcome of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dimensional Travel:</strong> Use the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong> to uncover secrets in hidden realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enigmatic Puzzles:</strong> Test your logic and wit to solve intricate riddles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lovecraftian Creatures:</strong> Survive cosmic horrors using your ingenuity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/ARKHAM_MYSTERIES_Tunel.png?t=1741373284\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Case Wrapped in Shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the shoes of detective <strong>John Graves</strong>, you will delve into a mystery where logic and sanity begin to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enigmatic singer <strong>Samantha Damasco</strong> has entrusted you with finding <strong>Professor Wellington</strong>, a man whose disappearance is tied to ancient secrets that should have remained buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the power of the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong>, you will cross the threshold of the impossible, unveiling horrors that lurk beyond reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some answers come at a price\u2026 <strong>Are you willing to pay it?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3013080?t=1741373284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/8283d6ddc1cd51af8c317871145feae28d2e3d79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741373284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/a36589839ee31030e36e8fbccfbd672583b12d8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741373284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/a36589839ee31030e36e8fbccfbd672583b12d8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741373284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3293220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/gif_live_on_.gif?t=1741373284\" /><strong>ARKHAM MYSTERIES: CHAPTER ONE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover what should never have been revealed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a <strong>narrative adventure of mystery and exploration</strong>, where every discovery brings you closer to the truth\u2026 or to your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/ARKHAM_MYSTERIES_COVER_3D.png?t=1741373284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As detective <strong>John Graves</strong>, you will follow the trail of the missing <strong>Professor Wellington</strong>, guided by the enigmatic <strong>Samantha Damasco</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/escena_bar.gif?t=1741373284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong> can reveal the unseen. Explore hidden dimensions and unravel enigmas while unknown forces lurk in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/gif_candado.gif?t=1741373284\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features &amp; Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-Person Exploration:</strong> Dive into a dark world full of mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Every decision will shape the outcome of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dimensional Travel:</strong> Use the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong> to uncover secrets in hidden realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enigmatic Puzzles:</strong> Test your logic and wit to solve intricate riddles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lovecraftian Creatures:</strong> Survive cosmic horrors using your ingenuity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/ARKHAM_MYSTERIES_Tunel.png?t=1741373284\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Case Wrapped in Shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the shoes of detective <strong>John Graves</strong>, you will delve into a mystery where logic and sanity begin to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enigmatic singer <strong>Samantha Damasco</strong> has entrusted you with finding <strong>Professor Wellington</strong>, a man whose disappearance is tied to ancient secrets that should have remained buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the power of the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong>, you will cross the threshold of the impossible, unveiling horrors that lurk beyond reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some answers come at a price\u2026 <strong>Are you willing to pay it?</strong></p>","developers":["Squidbit Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/header.jpg?t=1741373284","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257097695,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097695/movie480.mp4?t=1739980664","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257097695/movie_max.mp4?t=1739